#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:2
msgid "Managing subprojects"
msgstr "管理子项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:4
msgid ""
"Subprojects can be used to nest projects together under a single parent "
"project, which is most commonly used to share a single custom domain across "
"multiple projects."
msgstr "子项目可用于将多个项目嵌套在单一父项目下，最常见的用途是在多个项目间共享一个自定义域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`/subprojects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/subprojects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:10
msgid ""
"Learn what the subproject feature can do, how it works, and how to use "
"custom domains and subproject aliases."
msgstr "了解子项目功能能做什么、如何工作，以及如何使用自定义域名和子项目别名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:14
msgid "Adding a subproject"
msgstr "添加子项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:16
msgid "The following steps can be used to connect two existing projects together:"
msgstr "可用以下步骤将两个现有项目关联起来："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:18
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Subprojects` of the project that will act"
" as your **parent project**."
msgstr "前往将作为**父项目** 的项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Subprojects` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:20
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add subproject`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add subproject`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:22
msgid ""
"Choose a project to connect as a subproject using the :guilabel:`Subproject`"
" dropdown"
msgstr "使用 :guilabel:`Subproject` 下拉框选择要作为子项目关联的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:26
msgid "For users of |org_brand|"
msgstr "对于 |org_brand| 用户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:27
msgid ""
"You need to be *maintainer* of a subproject in order to choose it from your "
"main project."
msgstr "你需要是子项目的*维护者* 才能从主项目中选择它。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:29
msgid "For users of |com_brand|"
msgstr "对于 |com_brand| 用户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:30
msgid ""
"You need to have *admin access* to the subproject in order to choose it from"
" your main project."
msgstr "你需要对子项目拥有*管理员访问权限* 才能从主项目中选择它。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:32
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:36
msgid "Project subproject creation"
msgstr "项目子项目创建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you would like the subproject to use a different name in the URL "
"structure of your built documentation, you can alter that subproject "
":guilabel:`Alias` field -- otherwise leave this blank."
msgstr "若希望子项目在构建后文档的 URL 结构中使用不同名称，可修改该子项目的 :guilabel:`Alias` 字段——否则留空即可。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:41
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add subproject`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add subproject`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:43
msgid ""
"After adding the subproject, the URL the project is served from will by "
"changed to the URL displayed in the updated list of subprojects."
msgstr "添加子项目后，该项目的服务 URL 会变为更新后的子项目列表中显示的 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:46
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:50
msgid "Project subproject list with a new subproject added"
msgstr "添加新子项目后的项目子项目列表"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:60
msgid "Updating a subproject"
msgstr "更新子项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:62
msgid ""
"You can update a subproject by clicking the configure button |button-edit| "
"in the list of subprojects. On the following page, it's possible to change "
"both the subproject and its alias using the :guilabel:`Subproject` dropdown "
"and the :guilabel:`Alias` field. Click :guilabel:`Update subproject` to save"
" your changes."
msgstr ""
"你可以点击子项目列表中的配置按钮 |button-edit| 更新子项目。在接下来的页面中，可用 :guilabel:`Subproject` 下拉框和"
" :guilabel:`Alias` 字段同时更改子项目及其别名。点击 :guilabel:`Update subproject` 保存更改。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:52
msgid "Configure button"
msgstr "配置按钮"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:67
msgid ""
"The URL the subproject documentation is served from will be updated after "
"you save your changes."
msgstr "保存更改后，子项目文档的服务 URL 会随之更新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:70
msgid "Deleting a subproject"
msgstr "删除子项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:72
msgid ""
"You can delete a subproject connection by clicking the delete button "
"|button-delete| in the list of subprojects. Confirm the deletion on the "
"popup that shows to delete the subproject connection."
msgstr "你可以点击子项目列表中的删除按钮 |button-delete| 删除子项目关联。在弹出的确认框中确认删除该子项目关联。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:55
msgid "Delete button"
msgstr "删除按钮"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/subprojects.rst:75
msgid ""
"The subproject connection will be removed and the project that was "
"configured as a subproject will return to being served from it's own domain."
" **This will not remove either project, only the subproject relationship "
"will be removed.**"
msgstr "子项目关联将被移除，被配置为子项目的项目将恢复为从其自身域名提供服务。**这不会删除任何项目，只解除子项目关系。**"

